/td></tr><tr><td colspan="9"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr470/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="470" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr470"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasq4s17q/"></a>__________________________</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr471/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="471" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr471"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasye20hb/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr472/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="472" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr472"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasqyr8z0/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="4"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr473/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="473" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr473"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas9gfpgu/"></a>____________&#8206;&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr474/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="474" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr474"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasqisn40/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr475/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="475" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr475"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxgib3u/"></a>_________&#8206;&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr476/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="476" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr476"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfashpe7px/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="9"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr477/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="477" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr477"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaslbpt17/"></a>(Тадбиркорлик субъекти раҳбарининг Ф.И.О.)&#8206;&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr478/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="478" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr478"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasgrt5vp/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr479/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="479" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr479"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas8k919z/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="4"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr480/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="480" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr480"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfassm6col/"></a>(имзо)&#8206;&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr481/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="481" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr481"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasepodtu/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr482/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="482" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr482"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasgi99ci/"></a>(сана)</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr483/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="483" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr483"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasv4cml0/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr484/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="484" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas9wd3cc/"></a>Аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширишда онлайн-НКМ ва виртуал касса тизимини қўллаш тартиби тўғрисидаги низомга<br>4-ИЛОВА</p><img alt="" class="inimg" id="i1" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41927738/"><p style="text-align:right"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas4zwd2w/"></a>Аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширишда<br>онлайн-НКМ ва виртуал касса тизимини қўллаш<br>тартиби тўғрисидаги низомга<br>5-ИЛОВА</p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td colspan="8"><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="2"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit14/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas4029cg/"></a>Онлайн-НКМ, виртуал касса ва фискал модулни олиб қўйиш&#8206; (тагига чизилсин)&#8206;&#8206;<br>БАЁННОМАСИ &#8206;&#8206;&#8206;</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas0q5tmz/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;Биз, қуйида имзо чекувчилар ___________________________________________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="488" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr488"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasmkqa8w/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr489/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="489" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr489"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasc0slys/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr490/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="490" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr490"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfask3yump/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="4"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr491/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="491" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr491"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasliuguc/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;(текширувчиларнинг Ф.И.О., лавозими)</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr492/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="492" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr492"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxs9z89/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr493/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="493" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr493"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasnvtxle/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;___________________________________________ нинг 20___ йил &#171;___&#187; _______________даги _______-сон</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr494/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="494" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr494"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfast8sxal/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;(назорат органининг номи)</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr495/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="495" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr495"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas10kn3m/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr496/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="496" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr496"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasosz0on/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr497/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="497" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr497"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasblt678/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr498/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="498" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr498"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfase8l0fd/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr499/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="499" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr499"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas0p9sc4/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr500/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="500" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr500"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas0a5azs/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;буйруғига мувофиқ __________________________________________________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr501/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="501" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr501"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfast83d11/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr502/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="502" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr502"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasyxw6qy/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="6"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr503/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="503" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr503"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasgxrig3/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;(хўжалик юритувчи субъект ёки якка тадбиркор мансабдор шахси Ф.И.О.)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr504/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="504" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr504"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasfr2vr1/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;иштирокида завод рақами _________, 20___ йил &#171;___&#187; _________ да ____________________ рақам билан _______________ ДСИда рўйхатдан ўтказилган, _____________________________ манзилида жойлашган, СТИР___________, ____________________________________________________________ га тегишли бўлган</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr505/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="505" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr505"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasa1nhvz/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr506/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="506" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr506"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasmbwc0e/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="4"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaskggcni/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;(хўжалик юритувчи субъектнинг номи (Ф.И.О.)</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasaqu0l3/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasrqg31z/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas67gbld/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;___________________________________________ моделли (версияли) онлайн-НКМ, виртуал касса қурилмаси ва фискал модулни олиб қўйдик.<br>&#8206;<br>&#8206;Олиб қўйиш вақтида қуйидагилар аниқланди:<br>&#8206;Олиб қўйиш пайтида онлайн-НКМ, виртуал касса, фискал модулнинг ҳолати ______________________________<br>&#8206; ___________________________________________________________________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr511"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasdyda56/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;(умумий ҳолати (иш ҳолати, ишламайдиган ҳолати), шунингдек, алоҳида механик нуқсонлар кўрсатилади)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasy3h1q8/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;Ушбу баённома 3-нусхада тузилди.<br>&#8206;1-нусхаси онлайн-НКМ, виртуал касса, фискал модул эгасида қолади;<br>&#8206;2-нусхаси онлайн-НКМ, виртуал касса, фискал модулни олиб қўйган органда сақланади;<br>&#8206;3-нусхаси онлайн-НКМ, виртуал касса, фискал модул билан биргаликда экспертиза органига тақдим этилади.<br>&#8206;<br>&#8206;Баённома 20__ йил &#171;____&#187; ______________да</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr513/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="513" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr513"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasbtu0hq/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;__________________________________________________________<br>&#8206; (давлат солиқ хизмати органи мансабдор шахсининг Ф.И.О.)<br>&#8206;<br>&#8206;________________________________________________________<br>&#8206;________________________________________________________</p></td><td colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr514/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="514" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr514"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaso62g3e/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;_____________________<br>&#8206;(имзо)<br>&#8206;<br>&#8206;&#8206;&#8206;_____________________<br>&#8206;(имзо)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="5"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr515/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="515" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr515"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaswrz8hb/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;&#8206;тадбиркорлик субъекти вакиллари иштирокида тузилади.<br>&#8206;___________________________________________________________</p></td><td colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr516/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="516" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr516"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasb1h7yx/"></a>&#8206;&#8206;_____________________</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:right"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr517/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="517" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr517"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfask01dqa/"></a>Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг 2019 йил 23<br>ноябрдаги 943-сон қарорига<br>1а-ИЛОВА</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="1"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit15/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr518/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="518" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr518"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasb0eq8m/"></a>Аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширишда электрон тўлов ташкилоти ва (ёки) электрон тижорат платформалари (Маркетплейс) орқали электрон фискал чек тақдим қилиш тартиби тўғрисида<br>НИЗОМ</span></div><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit16/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr519/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="519" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr519"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaswips0p/"></a>1 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Умумий қоидалар</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr520/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="520" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr520"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas583psf/"></a>1. Ушбу Низом аҳоли билан Маркетплейс орқали амалга оширилган пулли ҳисоб китоблар учун харидорларга электрон фискал чек тақдим қилиш тартибини белгилайди.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr521/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="521" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr521"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas95ugei/"></a>2. Ушбу Низом талаблари қуйидагиларга татбиқ этилади:</p><ul><li style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr522/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="522" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr522"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasoeaqg8/"></a>Маркетплейс, шу жумладан тўлов ташкилотлар орқали аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширилганда харидорларга электрон фискал чек тақдим қилиш;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasoldg5v/"></a>тадбиркорлик субъектлари томонидан харидорларга жойларда харид қилинган маҳсулот ва хизматлар учун Маркетплейс, шу жумладан тўлов ташкилотлар орқали амалга оширилган тўловлар учун онлайн-НКМ ёки виртуал касса чекларини тақдим қилиш;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaseq7yfy/"></a>жойларда, шу жумладан, банкларда генерация қилинган ягона QR-код орқали амалга оширилган тўловлар тўғрисидаги маълумотларни операторга юбориш. Бунда ягона QR-код орқали амалга оширилган тўловларга ҳам назорат-касса техникаларидан мажбурий равишда чек берилиши шарт.</li></ul><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr523/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="523" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr523"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasl1fzhu/"></a>3. Мазкур Низомда қуйидаги асосий тушунчалардан фойдаланилади:</p><ul><li style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasdx8zsw/"></a>фискал маълумотлар &#8212; ҳисоб-китоблар тўғрисидаги маълумотлар, ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширувчи тадбиркорлик субъекти тўғрисида маълумот, ҳисоб-китобда фойдаланиладиган Маркетплейс орқали яратилган бошқа маълумотлар;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasdlzn2g/"></a><strong>виртуал фискал модул</strong> &#8212; оператор томонидан яратиладиган уникал рақам ва унга бириктирилган электрон рақамли имзо очиқ калит сертификати;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas7sz2mu/"></a>Ваколатли орган &#8212; Ўзбекистон Республикаси Солиқ қўмитаси;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfashga9xq/"></a>дастурларни дастурлаш интерфейси (Application Programming Interface) (кейинги ўринларда &#8212; API) &#8212; бир дастурий тизимнинг бошқа дастурий тизим билан ўзаро алоқада ишлаш усулларининг тавсифи;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas166tlr/"></a>Маркетплейс &#8212; оператор тизимига боғланиш имкониятига эга бўлган, операторга тақдим қилган чек маълумотлари асосида онлайн режимда фискал белгиларни қабул қилувчи, чекларни электрон шаклда харидорларга юбориш функциясига эга бўлган техника воситаларидан, ахборот технологияларидан ва ахборот тизимлари хизматларидан фойдаланган ҳолда электрон тўлов ҳужжатлари воситасида нақд ёки нақд пулсиз ҳисоб-китобларни амалга ошириш тизими;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasnotc4b/"></a>Маркетплейс реестри &#8212; қонунчилик ҳужжатларида белгиланган тартибда Давлат реестрига киритилган Маркетплейслар рўйхати.</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaszgf6lq/"></a>Маркетплейс фойдаланувчиси &#8212; товарлар (бажарилган ишлар ва кўрсатилган хизматлар) учун аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб китобларни амалга оширишда фискал маълумотларни Маркетплейс сервери орқали операторга юборувчи тадбиркорлик субъекти.</li></ul><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas6gqp4b/"></a>4. Фискал чек маълумотларни операторга юборилиши Маркетплейснинг виртуал фискал модули билан тасдиқлаш орқали амалга оширилади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr526/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="526" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr526"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas4flhvk/"></a>5. Операторга юбориладиган маълумотларнинг тўғрилиги ва ишончлилиги бўйича Маркетплейс жавобгар ҳисобланади.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit17/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr527/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="527" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr527"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas8tbcv2/"></a>2 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Операторга электрон фискал чек маълумотларини юбориш тартиби</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr528/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="528" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr528"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfassyabcs/"></a>6. Маркетплейслар тартиб рақам билан электрон фискал чек маълумотларини операторга юборади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr529/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="529" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr529"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasvagn4u/"></a>7. Оператор томонидан чек маълумотларига фискал белги яратиб, QR-код билан Маркетплейсларга қайтарилади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr530/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="530" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr530"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaszal3a6/"></a>8. Маркетплейс орқали харид чеки электрон шаклда тақдим этилганда, оператордан олинган электрон фискал чекнинг ҳаволасини харидор кўрсатган абонент рақамига ёки электрон почта манзилига, ёхуд харидорнинг шахсий кабинетига юборишини таъминлайди.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr531/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="531" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr531"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas53ghg7/"></a>9. Маркетплейс орқали реализация қилинган товар (хизмат) учун чек қоғоз шаклда тақдим этилган тақдирда, қоғоз чек ушбу қарорнинг 1-илова 7-банди талабларига мос равишда шаклланиши лозим.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit18/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr532/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="532" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr532"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas8z7pec/"></a>3 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Маркетплейс вазифалари ва мажбуриятлари</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr533/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="533" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr533"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfashfvurs/"></a>10. Маркетплейслар харидорларга электрон фискал чек тақдим қилиш учун операторнинг махсус ахборот тизими билан интеграция қилади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr534/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="534" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr534"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxomsde/"></a>11. Маркетплейслар:</p><ul><li style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr535/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="535" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr535"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasw9o90t/"></a>фискал чек маълумотларни шакллантириш, юбориш, қабул қилиш ва сақлаш имкониятини берадиган ахборот тизимига;</li><li style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas8y0qs9/"></a>call-марказига эга бўлиши лозим.</li></ul><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr536/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="536" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr536"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas7q3y2g/"></a>12. Маркетплейслар ўзининг маълумотлар базасида шакллантирилган фискал чек маълумотларни камида 5 йил давомида сақланишини ва фойдаланувчиларнинг шахсий маълумотлари ҳимоя қилиниши уларнинг конфиденциаллигини таъминлаши шарт, қонунчилик ҳужжатларида белгиланган ҳолатлар бундан мустасно.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit19/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr537/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="537" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr537"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasa3vsp9/"></a>3-1 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Электрон платформалар томонидан солиқ ахборот тизимларидан фойдаланиш тартиби</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr538/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="538" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr538"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasd27w8m/"></a>12<sup>1</sup>. Белгиланган тартибда Давлат реестрига киритилган электрон тижорат платформалари қонунчилик ҳужжатлари билан талаб этиладиган зарур маълумотлардан API орқали фойдаланиши мумкин.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr539/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="539" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr539"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasdihkh0/"></a>12<sup>2</sup>. Электрон тижорат платформалар солиқ органи ахборот тизимларидаги API дан фойдаланишга рухсат олиш учун ваколатли органга шахсий кабинети орқали мурожаат қилади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr540/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="540" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr540"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasc7ptos/"></a>12<sup>3</sup>. Ваколатли орган ўн иш куни мобайнида қуйидаги талаблар бир вақтнинг ўзида бажарилганлигини текширади ва API дан фойдаланишга рухсат беради:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr541/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="541" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr541"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfastcg4wt/"></a>б) Ўзбекистон Республикаси Адлия вазирлиги ҳузуридаги Персоналлаштириш агентлиги томонидан тақдим этиладиган Шахсга доир маълумотлар базасини Шахсга доир маълумотлар базаларининг давлат реестрида рўйхатдан ўтказилганлиги тўғрисидаги гувоҳномаси мавжудлиги;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr542/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="542" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr542"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasktwqh0/"></a>в) тизимга мурожаат қиладиган IP-манзил ҳамда маълумотларни қайта ишлайдиган техник воситаларнинг жисман Ўзбекистон Республикаси ҳудудида жойлашганлиги;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr543/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="543" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr543"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasab56ld/"></a>д) электрон тижорат платформалар томонидан API дан фойдаланишга рухсат олиш учун сўралаётган маълумотларнинг, электрон фискал чекларда бўлиши зарур бўлган маълумотларга мувофиқлиги.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr544/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="544" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr544"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasgoxmhs/"></a>Юқоридаги талабларга мувофиқ бўлмаган ҳолатларда ваколатли орган API орқали фойдаланишни рад этади ҳамда бу ҳақда мурожаатчига хабар юборади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr545/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="545" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr545"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasg5qyu8/"></a>12<sup>4</sup>. Электрон тижорат платформаларнинг API орқали юбориладиган техник сўровлари сони секундига 1 тадан ошмаслиги шарт.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr546/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="546" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr546"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasu10gzs/"></a>12<sup>5</sup>. Ваколатли орган API дан фойдаланувчи электрон тижорат платформаларнинг реестрини юритади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr547/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="547" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr547"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasu7tapf/"></a>12<sup>6</sup>. Электрон тижорат платформалар ўзининг маълумотлар базасида шахсга доир маълумотларнинг ва солиқ сирини ташкил этувчи маълумотларнинг конфиденциаллигини таъминлаши шарт.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr548/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="548" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr548"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasy1gcxw/"></a>12<sup>7</sup>.Электрон тижорат платформалар солиқ органи ахборот тизимларидан олинган шахсга доир маълумотларни ва солиқ сирини ташкил этувчи маълумотларни учинчи шахсларга ошкор этмаслиги ва тарқатмаслиги шарт.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit20/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr549/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="549" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr549"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas7pp6fw/"></a>4 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Маркетплейсларни Давлат реестрига киритиш</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr550/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="550" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr550"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxebyno/"></a>13. Маркетплейсларни Давлат реестрига киритилиши учун ваколатли органга иловага мувофиқ белгиланган шаклда Маркетплейслар томонидан ариза билан мурожаат қилинади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr551/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="551" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr551"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasywxkry/"></a>14. Ваколатли орган томонидан ариза берувчига Маркетплейсларга Давлат реестрига киритиш тўғрисидаги қарор нусхаси ёки уни рад этиш сабаби кўрсатилган жавоб хати ҳужжатлар тақдим этилган кундан бошлаб ўн беш иш кунида электрон ёки ёзма тарзда мурожаатчига тақдим этилади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr552/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="552" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr552"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaszkgtn9/"></a>15. Давлат реестрига киритиш рад этилганда, ариза берувчи камчиликларни бартараф этиб, ваколатли органга такроран мурожаат қилиши мумкин.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit21/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr553/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="553" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr553"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasgpz8yw/"></a>5 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Маркетплейсларни Давлат реестридан чиқариш</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr554/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="554" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr554"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasquq64z/"></a>16. Маркетплейсларни қуйидаги ҳолларда Давлат реестридан чиқарилади:</p><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr555/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="555" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr555"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasdpv62b/"></a>Маркетплейс тугатилганда, банкрот деб эътироф этилганда;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfassbep64/"></a>унинг фаолиятига нисбатан қонунчилик ҳужжатлари талаблари ўзгарганда;</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr557"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfascskw30/"></a>ваколатли органга қилган мурожаатига мувофиқ.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr558"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasg8swrg/"></a>17. Қонунчиликда белгиланган талаблар бажарилмаган тақдирда ваколатли орган томонидан Давлат реестрига киритилган Маркетплейсни ёзма огоҳлантирилган ҳолда оператор тармоғидан вақтинчалик ёки бутунлай узиши ва Давлат реестридан чиқариши мумкин.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasecoc8k/"></a>18. Маркетплейсни Давлат реестридан чиқариш ваколатли органнинг қарори асосида амалга оширилади.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit22/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr560"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasv248og/"></a>6 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Фойдаланувчиларни рўйхатдан ўтказиш</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr561/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="561" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr561"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasggsvnd/"></a>19. Маркетплейс орқали аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб китобларни амалга оширувчи тадбиркорлик субъектлари қонунчиликда белгиланган тартибда Маркетплейс билан ўзаро шартнома тузади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr562/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="562" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr562"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasqbvgcu/"></a>20. Маркетплейс ўзаро шартнома тақдим қилган тадбиркорлик субъекти маълумотларини операторнинг махсус ахборот тизимида қайд этади.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr563/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="563" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr563"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasy10zqa/"></a>21. Юборилган аризанинг маълумотларни нотўғри ёки белгиланган тартибда тўлдирилмаган бўлса Давлат солиқ хизмати органлари ходими томонидан рад қилинади. Маркетплейс камчиликларни бартараф қилиб 2-бандга мувофиқ қайта ариза юбориши мумкин.</p><div class="doc__chapter" data-type="chapter" data-level="4"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/tit23/"></a><span class="doc__chapter-number" style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr564/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="564" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr564"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasiyglcl/"></a>7 </span><span class="doc__chapter-name">-боб. Якуний қоидалар</span></div><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr565/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="565" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr565"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasg45y99/"></a>22. Ваколатли орган ва оператор ушбу Низом талабларига риоя этилиши юзасидан қонунчилик ҳужжатларига мувофиқ назоратни амалга оширадилар.</p><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr566/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="566" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr566"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas0y0dsv/"></a>23. Ушбу Низом талабларини бузган шахслар қонунчилик ҳужжатларида белгиланган тартибда жавоб берадилар.</p><p style="text-align:right"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr567/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="567" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr567"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas301foh/"></a>Аҳоли билан пулли ҳисоб-китобларни амалга оширишда<br>электрон тўлов ташкилоти ва (ёки) электрон тижорат<br>платформалари (Маркетплейс) орқали электрон<br>фискал чек тақдим қилиш тартиби тўғрисидаги Низомга<br>ИЛОВА</p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr568/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="568" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxpg386/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas1eq1w6/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasy9qa78/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfassmsrxy/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasgh6bz6/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaswx38wl/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="574" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr574"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas59qa1m/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr575/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="575" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr575"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas3eqkgh/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr576/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="576" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr576"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxf9lci/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasikny49/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasof2ygw/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaseguwln/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasl6wg11/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasqafi02/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas73ewqi/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas1rbl8w/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr584/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="584" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr584"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas94nlnf/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr585/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="585" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr585"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaskcdgbl/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr586/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="586" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr586"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfashgufpk/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr587/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="587" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr587"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaslu0vrv/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr588/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="588" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr588"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasxhr0dx/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr589/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="589" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr589"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasqlfg6r/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr590/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="590" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr590"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasugd5k5/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr591/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="591" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr591"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasapf7u1/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr592/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="592" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr592"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasyds8yd/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr593/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="593" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr593"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaspa51yi/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr594/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="594" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr594"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasah8klh/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr595/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="595" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr595"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasvf6q7d/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr596/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="596" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr596"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasu9g0gt/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr597/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="597" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr597"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasair26e/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr598/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="598" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr598"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasfqpdh5/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr599/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="599" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr599"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasabv9u8/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr600/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="600" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr600"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas3cadh7/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="7" rowspan="2"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr601/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="601" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr601"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas0g24a8/"></a><strong>&#8206;&#8207;Ўзбекистон Республикаси Солиқ қўмитасига</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr602/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="602" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr602"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasbm7iyz/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr603/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="603" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phra