-anchor" data-phrase-id="625" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr625"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasyuldmh/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="11"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr626/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="626" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr626"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas3iat8u/"></a>(юридик манзили)</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr627/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="627" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr627"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas0gbkay/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr628/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="628" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr628"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaswq5xle/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr629/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="629" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr629"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfask4ut3i/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr630/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="630" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr630"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasifgu9x/"></a>жойлашган _____________________________________________________________га</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr631/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="631" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr631"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasw7rtfd/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr632/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="632" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr632"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasd47uxe/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr633/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="633" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr633"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasoehzyx/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="16"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr634/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="634" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr634"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaslguteq/"></a>(мулкчилик шакли)</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr635/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="635" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr635"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasuz4l03/"></a>&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr636/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="636" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr636"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaspyh9bd/"></a>______________________________________________ русумли Маркетплейс(лар)нинг</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr637/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="637" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr637"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfaspxepc5/"></a>________________________________ версиясини иловада келтирилган ҳужжатлар асосида Давлат реестрига киритишингизни сўрайман.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr638/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="638" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr638"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasuuhe0e/"></a>Қуйидаги ҳужжатлар илова қилинади:<br>&#8206;1. Маркетплейс дастурий маҳсулотининг техник ва функционал тавсифларига мувофиқлиги юзасидан фискал маълумотлар операторининг хулосаси;<br>&#8206;2. Шакллантирилган электрон касса чеклари намуналари;<br>&#8206;3. Маркетплейс тизимининг эталон электрон намунаси (APK и URL website);<br>&#8206;4. Маркетплейснинг техник ва функционал тавсифлари батафсил кўрсатилган техник паспорт (ёки унга тенглаштирилган ҳужжат) ҳамда кафолат мажбуриятлари;<br>&#8206;5. Фойдаланиш ҳужжатлари (фойдаланувчи учун қўлланма, ўрнатиш бўйича қўлланма ва солиқ инспектори йўриқномаси);<br>&#8206;6. Маркетплейс дастурий маҳсулотининг муаллифлик ҳуқуқини тасдиқловчи ҳужжат (патент). Бунда ҳужжат бошқа давлатдан олинган бўлса унинг манбаси кўрсатилади;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="20"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas3c5exp/"></a><br><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr639/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="639" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr639"></a>&#8206;Илова: ____ варақда ёки электрон кўринишда (pdf, jpg, gif, jpeg форматда).</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas2wl7it/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr640/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="640" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr640"></a>&#8206;____________________________</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr641/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="641" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr641"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasftevyw/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr642/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="642" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr642"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfas3e51v4/"></a>&#8206;</p></td><td colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/dfasa2qese/"></a><br><a data-anchor="/document/90/20923/bssPhr643/" d